  "title": "Resolute Holdings Appoints David Marshall Chief Legal Counsel and Corporate Secretary",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, March 05, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Resolute Holdings Management, Inc. (“Resolute Holdings”) (NYSE: RHLD), an operating management company responsible for providing management services to the operating businesses of GPGI, Inc. (“GPGI”) (NYSE: GPGI), today announced the appointment of David A.P. Marshall as Chief Legal Counsel and Corporate Secretary of Resolute Holdings and GPGI, […]",
